<section id="controversy-law" class="relative isolate bg-[#F9F6F0] py-16 lg:py-20" data-ps="src/components/home/ControversyLaw.astro:section">
  <div class="max-w-[1000px] mx-auto px-4" data-ps="src/components/home/ControversyLaw.astro:90iqft">
    <div class="text-center max-w-[800px] mx-auto mb-12" data-ps="src/components/home/ControversyLaw.astro:90iqfq">
      <h2 class="text-[30px] sm:text-[34px] font-bold text-[#1A1A1A] font-serif mb-4" data-ps="src/components/home/ControversyLaw.astro:title">
        Tax Controversy Law in Utah
      </h2>
      <p class="text-[#374151] text-[15px] sm:text-[16px] leading-[1.7] m-0" data-ps="src/components/home/ControversyLaw.astro:intro">
        No one should have to deal with the IRS alone. As tax attorneys in Utah, we understand the complexities and challenges of tax law. One particular area that is often rife with confusion and legal disputes is tax controversy law.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- 3 Key Pillars with Icons -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mb-10" data-ps="src/components/home/ControversyLaw.astro:90iqfr">
      <!-- Pillar 1 -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-[8px] p-6 border border-gray-200 shadow-sm flex flex-col items-start" data-ps="src/components/home/ControversyLaw.astro:item-1">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-[#C1272D]/10 text-[#C1272D] flex items-center justify-center mb-4 shrink-0" data-ps="src/components/home/ControversyLaw.astro:90iqfs">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 6l3 1m0 0l-3 9a5.002 5.002 0 006.001 0M6 7l3 9M6 7l6-2m6 2l3-1m-3 1l-3 9a5.002 5.002 0 006.001 0M18 7l3 9m-3-9l-6-2m0-2v2m0 16V5m0 16H9m3 0h3" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-[18px] font-bold text-[#1A1A1A] font-serif mb-2" data-ps="src/components/home/ControversyLaw.astro:y6uztv">
          What is Tax Controversy Law?
        </h3>
        <p class="text-[#4B5563] text-[14px] leading-[1.6] m-0" data-ps="src/components/home/ControversyLaw.astro:mnxfth">
          Legal disputes that arise between taxpayers and taxing authorities (IRS or Utah State Tax Commission) over assessments, liability, or collection actions.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Pillar 2 -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-[8px] p-6 border border-gray-200 shadow-sm flex flex-col items-start" data-ps="src/components/home/ControversyLaw.astro:item-2">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-[#C1272D]/10 text-[#C1272D] flex items-center justify-center mb-4 shrink-0" data-ps="src/components/home/ControversyLaw.astro:90iqft">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.54 0 2.502-1.667 1.732-3L13.732 4c-.77-1.333-2.694-1.333-3.464 0L3.34 16c-.77 1.333.192 3 1.732 3z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-[18px] font-bold text-[#1A1A1A] font-serif mb-2" data-ps="src/components/home/ControversyLaw.astro:y6uztu">
          Key Controversy Issues
        </h3>
        <p class="text-[#4B5563] text-[14px] leading-[1.6] m-0" data-ps="src/components/home/ControversyLaw.astro:6554bx">
          Disputed tax assessments, aggressive collection tactics, unfiled returns, bank levies, and constitutional safeguards during audits.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Pillar 3 -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-[8px] p-6 border border-gray-200 shadow-sm flex flex-col items-start" data-ps="src/components/home/ControversyLaw.astro:item-3">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-[#C1272D]/10 text-[#C1272D] flex items-center justify-center mb-4 shrink-0" data-ps="src/components/home/ControversyLaw.astro:90iqfu">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-[18px] font-bold text-[#1A1A1A] font-serif mb-2" data-ps="src/components/home/ControversyLaw.astro:y6uztt">
          Attorney Defense & Strategy
        </h3>
        <p class="text-[#4B5563] text-[14px] leading-[1.6] m-0" data-ps="src/components/home/ControversyLaw.astro:6554bv">
          Providing specialized representation in negotiations, administrative appeals, and court hearings to protect your rights.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Conclusion Box -->
    <div class="bg-white border-l-4 border-[#C1272D] rounded-[8px] p-6 shadow-sm" data-ps="src/components/home/ControversyLaw.astro:conclusion">
      <h3 class="text-[18px] font-bold text-[#1A1A1A] font-serif mb-2" data-ps="src/components/home/ControversyLaw.astro:y6uzts">
        Conclusion & Next Steps
      </h3>
      <p class="text-[#374151] text-[15px] leading-[1.7] m-0" data-ps="src/components/home/ControversyLaw.astro:6554bu">
        Tax controversy law is a complex area of law that requires specialized knowledge and skills. Our experienced Utah tax attorneys play a critical role in helping taxpayers navigate disputes with taxing authorities and protect their legal rights.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
